    "text": "Booked quite last minute so was happy to still get a table later in the evening. Went around Christmas time and the place had a really cozy Christmas vibe. It was full and quite loud, but still easy enough to talk.\n\nStaff were really nice and attentive. We had the tuna tartare, steak & frites, bread and a fruit tart for dessert.\n\nFood was pretty average overall. I really liked the tuna tartare with the bread, but the steak was just okay, nothing too memorable. The fruit tart though was really good.\n\nNice place for the atmosphere and a casual dinner, especially around Christmas🎄",
    "textTranslated": null
  },
